{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10624415246664599484,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "K-th order statistic in O(N)",
      "source_hash": 16500101842902527587,
      "context_hash": 8725272172103645389,
      "translation": "O(N)의 K번째 순서 통계량",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125372Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "$K$th order statistic in $O(N)$",
      "source_hash": 5265093456487089719,
      "context_hash": 4184413146499304139,
      "translation": "$O(N)$에서 $K$번째 순위 통계량",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Given an array $A$ of size $N$ and a number $K$.",
      "source_hash": 1648014986109512652,
      "context_hash": 1457010262602768177,
      "translation": "크기가 $N$인 배열 $A$와 수 $K$가 주어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The problem is to find $K$-th largest number in the array, i.e., $K$-th order statistic.",
      "source_hash": 13392956452899148319,
      "context_hash": 7207579283010632737,
      "translation": "문제는 배열에서 $K$번째로 큰 수, 즉 $K$번째 순위 통계량을 찾는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The basic idea - to use the idea of quick sort algorithm.",
      "source_hash": 14693876516182409103,
      "context_hash": 230634724832361236,
      "translation": "기본 아이디어는 퀵 정렬 알고리즘의 아이디어를 사용하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Actually, the algorithm is simple, it is more difficult to prove that it runs in an average of $O(N)$, in contrast to the quick sort.",
      "source_hash": 12399864319630361758,
      "context_hash": 4406490414664454221,
      "translation": "사실 알고리즘 자체는 단순하지만, 퀵 정렬과 달리 이 알고리즘이 평균적으로 $O(N)$에 동작함을 증명하는 것은 더 어렵습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation (not recursive)",
      "source_hash": 14441570797134274890,
      "context_hash": 18196630129901729256,
      "translation": "구현 (비재귀)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Notes",
      "source_hash": 6248434630477978300,
      "context_hash": 4641681756955356913,
      "translation": "참고 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The randomized algorithm above is named [quickselect](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quickselect).",
      "source_hash": 7308736184949242654,
      "context_hash": 3794772117578920387,
      "translation": "위의 무작위 알고리즘은 [quickselect](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quickselect)라고 불립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "You should do random shuffle on $A$ before calling it or use a random element as a barrier for it to run properly.",
      "source_hash": 225575350342932259,
      "context_hash": 15929951285259712566,
      "translation": "이 알고리즘이 제대로 동작하려면 호출하기 전에 $A$에 무작위 셔플을 하거나, 무작위 원소를 경계로 사용해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125373Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "There are also deterministic algorithms that solve the specified problem in linear time, such as [median of medians](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Median_of_medians).",
      "source_hash": 11831406199170068432,
      "context_hash": 17617593109727069206,
      "translation": "[median of medians](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Median_of_medians)와 같이, 지정된 문제를 선형 시간에 해결하는 결정적 알고리즘도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125374Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[std::nth_element](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/algorithm/nth_element) solves this in C++ but gcc's implementation runs in worst case $O(n \\log n )$ time.",
      "source_hash": 8649742004912179280,
      "context_hash": 14907415745896818870,
      "translation": "[std::nth_element](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/algorithm/nth_element)는 C++에서 이를 해결하지만, gcc의 구현은 최악의 경우 $O(n \\log n )$ 시간에 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125374Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Finding $K$ smallest elements can be reduced to finding $K$-th element with a linear overhead, as they're exactly the elements that are smaller than $K$-th.",
      "source_hash": 1747177375773629631,
      "context_hash": 13275645612857317236,
      "translation": "$K$개의 가장 작은 원소를 찾는 것은 선형 오버헤드로 $K$번째 원소를 찾는 것으로 환원될 수 있는데, 이는 그 원소들이 정확히 $K$번째보다 작은 원소들이기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:39:05.125374Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
